From fc629f0402d5a5b0f4c09167d5372e71f5a93a12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 14:17:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD Vim visual selections for focused panes so terminal
 users can yank text

Implement focused-pane visual cursor and selection behavior for the terminal UI, including character, line, and block yanks across right-pane chat text and left-pane rows. The harness coverage exercises horizontal and vertical selections so the yank behavior remains tied to the active pane.
